{"id":"u104","kelas":"kosa","no":5,"judul":"Rumah dan Perabot","title":"Home and Furniture","emoji":"🛋️","ringkas":"Ruangan, perabot, peralatan rumah, dan menjelaskan letak","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **nama ruangan, perabot, dan peralatan rumah**","menyebut **letak benda** di dalam rumah","mengenali kata melalui **arti, ejaan, dan pendengaran**","membuat kalimat sederhana tentang rumah"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Rumah adalah tempat kita memakai bahasa Inggris setiap hari: menyebut ruangan, perabot, dan benda. Pelajari kata-kata di bawah ini dan gabungkan dengan preposisi tempat (in, on, under, next to) yang sudah kamu kenal."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Ruangan dan bagian rumah","items":[{"en":"bedroom","id":"kamar tidur","ex":"My bedroom is on the second floor."},{"en":"kitchen","id":"dapur","ex":"She is cooking in the kitchen."},{"en":"bathroom","id":"kamar mandi","ex":"The bathroom is next to my room."},{"en":"living room","id":"ruang tamu","ex":"We watch TV in the living room."},{"en":"garage","id":"garasi","ex":"The car is in the garage."},{"en":"garden","id":"taman","ex":"The garden has many flowers."},{"en":"roof","id":"atap","ex":"A cat is on the roof."},{"en":"stairs","id":"tangga","ex":"Be careful on the stairs."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Perabot","items":[{"en":"sofa","id":"sofa","ex":"We sit on the sofa."},{"en":"wardrobe","id":"lemari pakaian","ex":"The wardrobe is in the bedroom."},{"en":"shelf","id":"rak","ex":"The books are on the shelf."},{"en":"carpet","id":"karpet","ex":"The carpet is very soft."},{"en":"curtain","id":"tirai","ex":"Please close the curtain."},{"en":"mirror","id":"cermin","ex":"I look in the mirror."},{"en":"desk","id":"meja belajar","ex":"My desk is near the window."},{"en":"lamp","id":"lampu meja","ex":"Turn on the lamp."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Peralatan rumah","items":[{"en":"fridge","id":"kulkas","ex":"The milk is in the fridge."},{"en":"stove","id":"kompor","ex":"Do not touch the stove."},{"en":"oven","id":"oven","ex":"She baked a cake in the oven."},{"en":"washing machine","id":"mesin cuci","ex":"The washing machine is broken."},{"en":"fan","id":"kipas angin","ex":"Turn on the fan, please."},{"en":"broom","id":"sapu","ex":"Take the broom and sweep the floor."},{"en":"bucket","id":"ember","ex":"Fill the bucket with water."},{"en":"towel","id":"handuk","ex":"I need a clean towel."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Pindah rumah","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Mom, where does this box go?","id":"Bu, kotak ini ditaruh di mana?"},{"who":"Mother","en":"Put it in the kitchen, next to the fridge.","id":"Taruh di dapur, di sebelah kulkas."},{"who":"Dina","en":"And the lamp?","id":"Dan lampunya?"},{"who":"Mother","en":"Put it on the desk in your bedroom.","id":"Taruh di meja belajar di kamarmu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"OK! Where is the broom?","id":"Baik! Di mana sapunya?"},{"who":"Mother","en":"It is in the garage.","id":"Ada di garasi."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Tempelkan kertas bertuliskan nama benda (misalnya *mirror*, *shelf*) pada benda aslinya di rumahmu. Setiap kali melihatnya, ucapkan kata itu."},{"t":"summary","items":["Ruangan dan bagian rumah: [[bedroom]], [[kitchen]], [[bathroom]], [[living room]], [[garage]], [[garden]].","Perabot: [[sofa]], [[wardrobe]], [[shelf]], [[carpet]], [[curtain]], [[mirror]].","Peralatan rumah: [[fridge]], [[stove]], [[oven]], [[washing machine]], [[fan]], [[broom]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"bedroom\"?","options":["kamar tidur","dapur","tangga","sofa"],"answer":0,"exp":"bedroom = kamar tidur.","k":"e9aa0787"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"kamar tidur\" adalah...","options":["bedroom","mirror","carpet","kitchen"],"answer":0,"exp":"kamar tidur = bedroom.","k":"3d6a694a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"kamar tidur\":","q":"My ___ is on the second floor.","answers":["bedroom","bedroom"],"hint":"b _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"kamar tidur = bedroom.","k":"c8889708"},{"type":"mcq","q":